# CI artifacts — all logs are ignored, manifests/baselines are committed.
# Glob so any transient log is covered (full-suite.log, pytest-output.log,
# smart-test-fallback.log, release-check-pytest.log, and any future one) —
# an untracked *.log here once tripped release-check's clean-tree gate.
*.log

# smart-test runtime locks (process-local, never committed)
.smart-test.lock
.smart-test.lock.pid
